---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Gas Cost Calculator"
description: "Estimate fuel needed and total gas cost for a trip (miles, MPG, $/gal). Runs locally."
pageScript: "/assets/tools/gas-cost.js"
---

<h1 data-i18n="tools.item.gas-cost.title">Gas Cost Calculator</h1>
<p class="muted" data-i18n="tools.localNotice">Runs locally in your browser. Nothing is uploaded.</p>

<section class="tool-shell">
  <div class="tool-grid">
    <div class="tool-pane">
      <label class="tool-label" for="tool-input" data-i18n="tool.gasCost.distance">Distance (miles)</label>
      <input
        id="tool-input"
        class="tool-textarea"
        type="text"
        inputmode="decimal"
        autocomplete="off"
        spellcheck="false"
        placeholder="e.g. 120"
        data-i18n-placeholder="tool.gasCost.distancePlaceholder"
      />

      <div class="tool-options">
        <label class="tool-option">
          <span data-i18n="tool.gasCost.mpg">Fuel economy (MPG)</span>
          <input type="number" id="opt-mpg" min="1" max="200" step="0.1" value="28" />
        </label>
        <label class="tool-option">
          <span data-i18n="tool.gasCost.price">Gas price ($/gal)</span>
          <input
            type="text"
            id="opt-price"
            inputmode="decimal"
            autocomplete="off"
            spellcheck="false"
            placeholder="e.g. 3.79"
            data-i18n-placeholder="tool.gasCost.pricePlaceholder"
          />
        </label>
        <label class="tool-option">
          <span data-i18n="tool.gasCost.trips">Trips</span>
          <input type="number" id="opt-trips" min="1" max="1000" step="1" value="1" />
        </label>
        <label class="tool-option">
          <input type="checkbox" id="opt-roundtrip" />
          <span data-i18n="tool.gasCost.roundTrip">Round trip (×2)</span>
        </label>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="tool-pane">
      <label class="tool-label" for="tool-output" data-i18n="tool.common.output">Output</label>
      <textarea
        id="tool-output"
        class="tool-textarea"
        rows="12"
        readonly
        placeholder="Result will appear here…"
        data-i18n-placeholder="tool.common.resultPlaceholder"
        spellcheck="false"
      ></textarea>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="tool-actions">
    <button class="button" type="button" id="btn-calc" data-i18n="tool.gasCost.calculate">Calculate</button>
    <button class="button button-secondary" type="button" id="btn-copy" data-i18n="tool.common.copyOutput">
      Copy output
    </button>
    <button class="button button-secondary" type="button" id="btn-clear" data-i18n="tool.common.clear">
      Clear
    </button>
  </div>

  <p class="muted small" id="tool-status" role="status"></p>
</section>

